WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.320
Research integrity functions as the
foundation of empirical truth.

2
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.000
The validity of scientific findings
depends on the consistency and

3
00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:10.680
transparency of the methods used to
produce them.

4
00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:15.280
To standardise these methods, the European
Union utilises a specific governing

5
00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:19.260
architecture, the European Code of Conduct
for Research Integrity.

6
00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:23.300
This framework integrates into European
Union research infrastructures,

7
00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:26.940
establishing the protocols for
institutional conduct and compliance.

8
00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:31.060
We are going to deconstruct how this
framework operates, examining both its

9
00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:34.460
theoretical principles and the operational
practices required for

10
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:39.100
implementation. Producing reliable science
requires an understanding of how

11
00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:42.820
this integrated architecture functions
across different research disciplines.
